        <body>
            <div xml:id="d374-a5">

                <pb facs="0692" n="630" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg630"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Copy of coupon</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p>The United States of Mexico and States of Tamaulipas and San Luis Potosi will pay
                    to bearer thirty-five dollars, for six months’ interest, due September 1st,
                    1874, on bond No. 3374, for $1,000.</p>
                <closer><signed>JOSÉ M. J. CARBAJAL.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
